[Vocab] 訪れる

16
00:02:14,788 --> 00:02:19,539
[Host] It means to visit — a slightly formal word for going to a place.

17
00:02:20,139 --> 00:02:29,355
[Slow] ジブリパークは、スタジオジブリの映画の世界を楽しむことができる公園です。

18
00:02:30,156 --> 00:02:34,955
[Host] Ghibli Park is a park where you can enjoy the world of Studio Ghibli's movies.

19
00:02:35,556 --> 00:02:37,644
[Vocab] 映画

20
00:02:38,044 --> 00:02:40,300
[Host] It means a movie or a film.

21
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:50,907
[Slow] 両陛下は、アジア大会の開会式に出るために、愛知県を訪れていました。

22
00:02:51,707 --> 00:02:58,572
[Host] The Emperor and Empress were visiting Aichi Prefecture to attend the opening ceremony of the Asian Games.

23
00:02:59,171 --> 00:03:01,836
