24
00:03:02,235 --> 00:03:06,771
[Host] It means an opening ceremony — the event that starts a big competition.

25
00:03:07,372 --> 00:03:17,211
[Slow] 両陛下は、映画「となりのトトロ」の「ネコバス」に乗って、窓から笑顔を見せました。

26
00:03:18,012 --> 00:03:25,283
[Host] The Emperor and Empress got on the Cat Bus from the movie My Neighbor Totoro, and showed big smiles from the window.

27
00:03:25,883 --> 00:03:28,044
[Vocab] 笑顔

28
00:03:28,443 --> 00:03:30,627
[Host] It means a smiling face.

29
00:03:31,228 --> 00:03:39,580
[Slow] 映画「千と千尋の神隠し」の「カオナシ」の横にも、座りました。

30
00:03:40,379 --> 00:03:45,587
[Host] They also sat down next to No-Face, the character from the movie Spirited Away.

31
00:03:46,187 --> 00:03:48,419
[Vocab] 座る

32
00:03:48,819 --> 00:03:50,907
